  offerLine: Next phase. Serve the juice to the public, twice. Watch their faces. If anyone smiles, tell me immediately. I'm not joking. Nobody has ever smiled.
  activeLine: Have you served it? Did they smile? Did YOU smile?
  readyLine: Nobody smiled. Perfect. Take this umbrella. You'll need it when the frogs start. I can't say more.
  doneLine: It won't be long now. Look up, sometimes.
